WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:02.490
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:06.250
I'm Emil from Pongfinity and welcome to another
episode of Challenge Pongfinity!

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:11.040
This is the series where YOU challenge US
with your craziest ideas related to table

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.040
tennis.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.099
We will go through all of your comments, pick
the most creative ones and make a video out

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:15.620
of them.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:18.860
If your idea gets picked, we will feature
it in the video and give you a shout out.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.580
So be sure to leave your ideas in the comment-section
below!

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.460
First up is a Facebook-comment that comes
from Gregory Sellers.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.060
Break a single stick of spaghetti by smashing
it from 10 meters away

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:37.940
and then have 10 sticks and smash those from
1 meter away.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.020
This will be an interesting one!

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:04.320
Alright, next up is 10 sticks and only from
1 meter away.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.980
Ooh, that was quite a few.

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:10.560
That was...

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:14.320
I think all of them but one.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:15.140
Pretty good!

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:29.780
Let's try to hit them 1 more time!

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.740
Ahh, okay.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:39.480
Shark Lite wants us to bounce a ping pong
ball over 3 times on the water.

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:42.560
This reminds a bit of throwing rocks on the
water like this.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:50.400
I have no idea how this will work with a ping
pong ball, but let's find that out!

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.640
I'll give it 5 shots.

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:55.080
Okay, this is the first one.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:02.280
That was 3 or 4 maybe?

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:03.380
That was a good start!

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.080
Second one.

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.420
Okay, the 3rd one.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:24.480
Aaah, only 2 or 3.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.320
Then the 4th one.

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.540
Then the last one, 5th one.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.460
Let's try to get 5!

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:41.960
Ooh, I think that was 4 maybe?

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:46.740
We will have to check the GoPro camera, the
slow-mo camera to see if there was 4 or 5.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:49.720
But at least we got 3 that Shark Lite wanted!

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:15.400
So, this is our pumpkin.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:19.720
Let's try to see if we can do any damage on
it with some ping pong shots.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:00.960
So as you can see the pumpkin survived, it's
still smiling

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:04.320
Nothing much happened with it, but it was
fun to try out!

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:10.360
Thanks for watching, I had a fun time filming
this video outside here in Finland although

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.770
it's only a couple of degrees here right now.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:16.400
But if you enjoyed the video leave it a thumbs
up and if you are new to the channel subscribe

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.579
right here and watch the previous episodes
here.

00:04:19.579 --> 00:04:20.480
Until next time!

